      "description": "This data was collected during the project: Preparation of a high-level least-cost geospatial analysis for grid and off-grid electrification options Synoptic analysis of low-cost electrification solutions in Congo The geospatial planning exercise examined the least cost options for grid extension, off-grid supply and distributed energy solutions in Congo based on the scenarios outlined above. The consultant identified 6 biomass projects that could be developed both to electrify rural communities on an off-grid basis as well as potential sites for grid injection",
